<title>SINGAPORE: Tye Soon public share offer 70.6 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>Tye Soon public share offer 70.6 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The public portion of Tye Soon Ltd's new share offer has been 70.6 times subscribed, the company said oon Friday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the public portion comprised 41.89 million shares at Singapore $0.31 each. The placement portion of 17.95 million shares was also fully taken up.</p>
<p>Trading for the automotive component distributor starts on Monday.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
